1. scale dependence
   dF/dln mu^2 at O(a)   : 0 (must be 0)
   O(a^2) remainder      : (4*C2g*Pgg*g_N + 4*C2g*Pgq*Sigma_N - 2*C2g*beta0*g_N + 4*C2q*Pqg*g_N + 2*C2q*Pqq*Sigma_N - C2q*Sigma_N*beta0 + 4*L*Pgg*Pqg*g_N + 4*L*Pgq*Pqg*Sigma_N + 4*L*Pqg*Pqq*g_N - 2*L*Pqg*beta0*g_N + 2*L*Pqq**2*Sigma_N - L*Pqq*Sigma_N*beta0)/2
   dF/dln mu_R^2         : -a**2*beta0*(2*C2g*g_N + C2q*Sigma_N + 2*L*Pqg*g_N + L*Pqq*Sigma_N)/2   = -(beta0/2) a^2 [C2q Sig + 2 C2g g] at L=0: True
   dF_L/dln mu^2 at O(a) : 0  (F_L mu independent at O(a))
2. DIS scheme
   momentum sum (any N): Sigma^DIS + g^DIS - (Sigma + g) = 0
   F_2 (MSbar) - [ (q+qbar)^DIS + a L (Pqq ... ) ] = 0   -> C_2^DIS = L P
   C_L unchanged at O(a): the O(a) term of F_L contains no PDF change at this order (shift is O(a^2)).
   P'^(1) = P^(1) + Z P^(0) - P^(0) Z - (beta0/2) Z  : True
   non-singlet: P'^(1)_NS - P^(1)_NS = -C2q*beta0/2
